---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Cosmetic & Plastic Surgery in India – CareBridge Health">
  <main class="container mx-auto px-5 py-12 max-w-4xl">
    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-6">
      Cosmetic & Plastic Surgery in India
    </h1>

    <p class="text-slate-600 text-lg mb-8">
      For selected, medically appropriate cases we coordinate cosmetic and
      reconstructive procedures with experienced plastic surgeons in India.
    </p>

    <section class="mb-10 space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Procedures We Commonly Coordinate</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-slate-600">
        <li>Rhinoplasty (nose reshaping)</li>
        <li>Facelift, eyelid and brow procedures</li>
        <li>Breast surgery (augmentation, reduction, lift)</li>
        <li>Body contouring & liposuction (for suitable BMI ranges)</li>
        <li>Reconstructive surgery after injury or illness</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-10 space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Safety & Eligibility</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600">
        Every case is screened for medical safety first. Surgeons may request
        blood tests, imaging and physician clearance before confirming your
        procedure. We never promise results that are unrealistic or unsafe.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="bg-slate-50 rounded-xl p-6 mt-4">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">Discuss a Cosmetic Procedure</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 mb-4">
        Share your goals privately with our coordination team. We’ll advise what
        is realistic, what may not be recommended, and which specialists may be
        a fit.
      </p>
      <a
        href="https://wa.me/919080553616"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener"
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-5 py-3 rounded bg-blue-600 text-white font-medium hover:bg-blue-700"
      >
        Chat Confidentially on WhatsApp
      </a>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
